      "summary": "Contested finding: external academic study (LIT-007) reports hERG IC50 = 4.8 micromolar with a free-drug safety margin narrower than the 30-fold reassurance threshold; internal GLP hERG assay (IR-006) reports IC50 > 30 micromolar with a margin exceeding 30-fold, and the dedicated Phase 2 Holter/QTc substudy (CT-004) shows no clinical QTc signal at therapeutic doses. The in vitro numeric discrepancy between LIT-007 and IR-006 is explicitly acknowledged as unresolved by both IR-006 and CT-004 rather than dismissed or explained."
    }
